@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName DejaVu Sans
skinparam classBackgroundColor #EDF5F3
skinparam classBorderColor #42697A
skinparam ArrowColor #42697A
hide empty members
title Code - Bounded live and stopped recovery
class "LiveRepair" as LiveRepair <<class>> [[https://github.com/JasonLn0711/project_aura/blob/main/src/aura/reuse_live_repair.py#L15]] {
  start()
  close()
}
class "resolve_live_gaps" as resolve_live_gaps <<function>> [[https://github.com/JasonLn0711/project_aura/blob/main/src/aura/reuse_live_repair.py#L180]] {
  (session)
}
class "ReuseRecovery" as ReuseRecovery <<class>> [[https://github.com/JasonLn0711/project_aura/blob/main/src/aura/reuse_recovery.py#L108]] {
  close()
}
class "enhance_source" as enhance_source <<function>> [[https://github.com/JasonLn0711/project_aura/blob/main/src/aura/reuse_recovery.py#L14]] {
  (worker, audio, policy, before_push)
}
class "usable_enhancement" as usable_enhancement <<function>> [[https://github.com/JasonLn0711/project_aura/blob/main/src/aura/reuse_recovery.py#L36]] {
  (original, enhanced, prefix)
}
class "uncovered_intervals" as uncovered_intervals <<function>> [[https://github.com/JasonLn0711/project_aura/blob/main/src/aura/reuse_recovery.py#L58]] {
  (total, covered, start)
}
LiveRepair --> enhance_source : fresh-state bounded enhancement
ReuseRecovery --> enhance_source : explicit stopped enhancement
LiveRepair --> usable_enhancement : enhanced speech gate
ReuseRecovery --> uncovered_intervals : preserves submitted jobs
resolve_live_gaps --> LiveRepair : resolves only closed completed parents
@enduml
